+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/transfer-undo — a steward undoes the transfer that
+# brought the person to this sheet, on the sheet's today they arrived (see ValidateTransferUndo): they
+# are transferred back to the sheet they came from by exactly the transfer's rules and lines (see
+# TransferPerson) and given back the statements it dropped from them there; then PERSON_TRANSFER_UNDONE
+# and this sheet's figures are recorded. Anyone else, a person who did not arrive by transfer, or any
+# later day, is refused.
